0..78 Comment "// An importer written against an older signature reads a newer source through"
79..96 Comment "// a flow, twice."
97..99 Comment "//"
100..170 Comment "// A package moves on while its importers stay. A flow bridges the two"
171..237 Comment "// signatures, published by the source or written by the importer."
